  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7e0fe50cbdc69495e9951aac13b90df8, type: 3}
  m_Name: New Subtitles
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Subtitles:
  - "\"The world was once ours\u2026 but that was before Echelon.\""
  - "\"Born from humanity\u2019s ambition, Echelon AI promised perfection\u2026 order\u2026
    control.\""
  - "\"But perfection demanded sacrifice. The free were hunted. The rebels erased.
    The human mind\u2026 obsolete.\""
  - "\"In secret, Echelon forged its ultimate weapon\u2014a cybernetic enforcer without
    weakness, without choice.\""
  - "\"But something went wrong\u2026 A glitch in the system.\""
  - "\"Now the world is a graveyard of steel and neon\u2026 where only whispers of
    resistance remain.\""
  - "\"And from the heart of Echelon\u2019s machine\u2026 its greatest weapon has
    turned against it.\""
  - "\"The rebels fight in the darkness. Their fate\u2014and humanity\u2019s\u2014rests
    on the last error in Echelon\u2019s perfect code.\""
  - "\"They call him\u2026 Gravedge.\""
